<title>NIGERIA: Nigerian Seven-Up 6-mth profit up.</title>
<headline>Nigerian Seven-Up 6-mth profit up.</headline>
<dateline>LAGOS 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year result for soft drinks bottlers Seven-Up Nigeria Plc to end-September 1996. (In million naira)</p>
<p>				  1996	   1995</p>
<p>Turnover			1,400    vs 1,000</p>
<p>Profit before taxation     42.4    vs  15.0</p>
<p>Taxation			 12.7    vs   3.7</p>
<p>Profit after taxation 29.6 vs 11.3 ($1=80 naira)</p>
<p>-- Lagos newsroom +234 1 263 03 17</p>
</text>
